  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening MSME Business Membership Organizations in Ukraine: Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to boost the resilience and competitiveness of Ukrainian MSMEs, supporting inclusive economic recovery and sustainable development. It will align and integrate the BMO sector for better MSME representation, strengthen BMO capacities for organizational and financial sustainability, and improve public-private dialogue to enhance MSME policies. The project is fully aligned with the Country Programme Document for Ukraine (2025-2029) and the UN Sustainable Development Cooperation Res</narrative>
  </description>
